\pard\li720 sha256 8c3850283eb25fa026482078a04051e0be17347b09ef81a0849bec15a96e002e\par
\pard\li360 This release of Livepaper carries a copy of that archive, with the build script and the configure line:\par
\pard\li720 https://github.com/oTerminal/Livepaper/releases/download/v0.1.0/ffmpeg-9.0.2.tar.xz\par
\pard\li360 To run your own ffmpeg build instead of this one:\par
\pard\li720 defaults write app.livepaper.Livepaper FFmpegReplacement /path/to/ffmpeg\par
\pard\li360 and to go back to this one:\par
\pard\li720 defaults delete app.livepaper.Livepaper FFmpegReplacement\par
